OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers' traffic fears over farm
OL,4,Adevelopment plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a Kent village are
OL,7,Fcampaigning against plans to develop a
OL,8,Ffarm over fears of increased traffic.
OL,10,FHildenborough Parish Council claimed
OL,11,Fthe proposal for a change of use to
OL,12,F"light industrial", submitted by the
OL,13,Fowners of Great Hollanden Farm in Mill
OL,14,FLane, Underriver, could see over 100
OL,15,Fvehicle movements each day.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32202
