OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1789710466
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers' traffic fears over farm
OL,4,Adevelopment plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FElizabeth Shirtcliff, who lives nearby,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We're in the middle of a small
OL,8,Fhamlet, we're surrounded by lanes,
OL,9,Fthey're very narrow, they are poorly
OL,10,Fmaintained, we have a lot of potholes,
OL,11,Fditches, hedges. The roads just cannot
OL,12,Fsustain this."
OL,14,FThe Fairlawne Estate, which owns the
OL,15,Ffarm, said the plans would "not turn
OL,16,Ffarmland into a lorry park for HGVs and
OL,17,Farticulated vehicles".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
